sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as "Manager/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (manager.shift-swap-approvals.show/index)"
    participant Controller as "ShiftSwapApprovalController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Manager->>View: Klik Setujui permintaan
    View->>Controller: POST /manager/shift-swap-approvals/{id}/approve
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi input notes (opsional)
    Controller->>Model: Ambil swap request by id
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>Model: Data swap request

    alt Data valid (status menunggu persetujuan)
        Controller->>Model: Proses approveByManager(id, manager_id, notes)
        Model->>DB: UPDATE shift_swap_requests\nSET status='approved', manager_id=?, manager_approved_at=NOW()
        DB-->>Model: Update success
        Model-->>Controller: Approved
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Manager: Notifikasi berhasil menyetujui
    else Data tidak valid (status tidak sesuai/id tidak ada)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Manager: Notifikasi gagal menyetujui
    end
